        en: 'Four weeks in San Jose. The badge is no longer warm, the coffee is still a rumour, and a model called Laplace is being taught to be good. In Zürich, a former classmate is reading its report card.',
        zh: '在 San Jose 的第四周。工牌不再温热，咖啡依旧是个传说，而一个叫 Laplace 的模型正在被教导着变好。在 Zürich，一位大学同学正在读它的成绩单。'
