            date: '2027-02-08',
            body: {
                en: 'To: {name}\nFrom: People Ops Zürich — Nadia Perret\nSubject: Zürich onboarding — badge, registration, insurance, German course\nReference: PO-ZRH-ONB-0210\n\nWelcome to Zürich. The items below require action within the stated periods.\n\n1. Badge\nCollect at reception on the ground floor. Mr. Brunner will ask for your passport. Access is active from Monday 8 February, 07:00 CET.\n\n2. Residence registration\nRegister at the Kreisbüro within 14 days of arrival. Bring the lease, the employer letter and your passport. Queues are shorter before 07:30.\n\n3. Health insurance\nEnrol within three months. The form is in the onboarding folder. Check the deductible before selecting a plan; the lowest premium is not the lowest total cost.\n\n4. German course\nTuesdays, 18:00, fourth floor. Attendance is recorded; no grade is issued.\n\n5. Facilities\nThe fourth-floor coffee machine is out of service and a replacement part is on order. The radiator by your desk makes a noise; it is functioning as designed.\n\n6. Local notice\nFasnacht begins next week. Expect road closures and interrupted tram service. This is not a security incident.\n\nOffice hours: 08:00–16:30. Reply to this mailbox for onboarding questions; do not contact individual teams directly.\n\nNadia Perret\nPeople Ops, Zürich\nPO-ZRH-ONB-0210',
                zh: '收件人：{name}\n发件人：People Ops Zürich——Nadia Perret\n主题：Zürich 入职——工牌、登记、保险、德语课\n编号：PO-ZRH-ONB-0210\n\n欢迎来到 Zürich。以下事项须在规定期限内办理。\n\n1. 工牌\n在一层前台领取。Brunner 先生会核验护照。门禁自 2 月 8 日（周一）07:00 CET 起生效。\n\n2. 居住登记\n抵达后 14 天内到 Kreisbüro 登记。请携带租约、雇主证明与护照。07:30 之前排队较短。\n\n3. 医疗保险\n三个月内参保。表格在入职文件夹中。选择方案前请核对免赔额；最低保费不等于最低总成本。\n\n4. 德语课\n每周二 18:00，四楼。出勤记录，不打分。\n\n5. 设施\n四楼咖啡机停用，替换零件已订购。你工位旁的暖气片有响声，属于正常工况。\n\n6. 本地提示\n下周 Fasnacht 开始。届时将有道路封闭与电车中断。这不是安全事件。\n\n办公时间：08:00–16:30。入职相关问题请回复本邮箱，不要直接联系各团队。\n\nNadia Perret\nPeople Ops，Zürich\nPO-ZRH-ONB-0210'
            }
