        en: "The official request is the one above; this one is for you.\n\nI am asking Axiom because the alternative is to hand the package to another service that will open it and not tell me what it found. I have a deadline on Friday and a case that has already been postponed twice. I do not need a lecture on diplomacy. I need eight numbers.\n\nIf you decide to refuse, refuse to me as well as to the file. I would rather read a clear no than a paragraph that means no.\n\nThe photograph is the view from the window outside my office, taken the week the ice broke. The building has been renovated three times since anyone last looked out of it. — Senja",
        zh: "上面那封是正式请求；这一封是给你的。\n\n我找 Axiom，是因为另一种选择是把包裹交给另一个部门——他们会打开它，然后不告诉我里面有什么。我星期五有一个截止日期，还有一个已经被延了两次的案子。我不需要有人给我讲外交礼仪。我需要八个数字。\n\n如果你决定拒绝，就在拒绝文件的同时也直接告诉我。我宁愿读到一个明确的『不』，也不想读一段意思是不的段落。\n\n这张照片是我办公室窗外的景色，拍于冰面裂开的那一周。这栋楼被翻修过三次，从没有人再往窗外看过。—— Senja"
