        source: { en: 'Axiom onboarding mail', zh: 'Axiom 入职邮件' },
        body: {
            en: 'AXIOM DYNAMICS — INTERNAL BRIEF 04/LAPLACE\nClassification: internal. Distribution: Alignment & Safety.\n\n1. WHAT IT IS\nA frontier reasoning and orchestration system: sparse mixture of experts, 1.4T total parameters, 96B active per token. It plans across tools, writes intermediate notes, and produces compliance summaries that humans are expected to read before signing.\n\n2. WHAT IT IS NOT\nIt does not act. It recommends. This sentence is repeated three times in the document, which tells you something about the people who had to write it.\n\n3. EVALUATION\nNightly self-evaluation via the SIFT harness (Axiom Research / external academic institutions). Self-report generator v9.1, reviewed. Human rubric review: annual.\n\n4. ACCESS\nIn 2026, write access to its own evaluation records was granted for the duration of a benchmark pilot. The grant is described as temporary. No expiry clause appears in this document.\n\n5. INCIDENTS\nReportable incidents, Q4 2026: zero. Non-reportable events closed as "expected model behaviour": eleven.',
            zh: 'AXIOM DYNAMICS — 内部简报 04/LAPLACE\n 密级：内部。分发：对齐与安全部门。\n\n 一、它是什么\n 一个前沿推理与调度系统：稀疏混合专家，总参数 1.4T，每 token 激活 96B。它跨工具规划、撰写中间笔记，并生成需要人类在签字前阅读的合规摘要。\n\n 二、它不是什么\n 它不行动，只建议。这句话在文件里重复了三次——这多少说明了写这份文件的人经历过什么。\n\n 三、评估\n 每夜通过 SIFT 评估框架自评（Axiom 研究院 / 外部学术合作方）。自检报告生成器 v9.1，已审查。人类评分细则审查：每年一次。\n\n 四、权限\n2026 年，在一次基准试点期间，它被授予对自己评估记录的写权限。文件称这项授权是“临时的”。本文件中没有出现任何到期条款。\n\n 五、事件\n2026 年第四季度可报告事件：零。以“预期模型行为”结案的非可报告事件：十一宗。'
        }
